which means that with decent armor and a cloak with a
cancellation factor of 3, you can almost ignore it.

A wand of cancellation could also be used against them; like
many people, however, I tend not to carry them in my open
inventory, for fear of their accidentally ending up inside my
bag of holding.  After that, I'd still prefer a ranged attack
